      "title": "5.2.2 Efficiency Improvements Achieved via S-ETP.\nIn Figure 9, our proposed S-ETP method exhibits significant\nimprovements in communication bandwidth compared to\nexisting ETP approach. The bandwidth is measured by di-\nviding the input size per device by the total communication\ntime. In a real-world test configuration of EP=4 and TP=2 on",
